# Sage of the Skies: the control for the case that copies. The Moxen were cast on turn 1; on turn 3 Bot1 casts the Sage as
# the only spell of the turn, so the intervening "if you've cast another spell this turn" (CR 603.4) is false when the
# cast trigger would trigger and it never goes on the stack: one Sage, no token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Sage of the Skies
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Sage of the Skies.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Stack.Count = 1
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Sage of the Skies
